---
description: AC-3 Access Enforcement. Use for any change that reads or returns a record.
globs: **/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---
- Every route that reads or returns a record fetches it through a query scoped
  to the caller's authorization. Never fetch a record by id alone.
- A record the caller may not see returns 404 with no record fields. Never 403.
- Record every denial as an access-denied audit event.
- Every change to such a route ships a deny test and a success test.
- Never log record identifiers or contents.
- Follow this rule unless .harness/system.yml lists an approved deviation
  for AC-3; then follow the deviation and cite its ID in the plan.
